					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Some grammar stuff:</p> <p>First paragraph has &quot;too see&quot; which should be &quot;to see&quot;. Third has a &quot;bee&quot; that should be a &quot;be&quot;, unless it became bees. Fourth, &quot;even now, there are still trying&quot; should be &quot;they are&quot;.</p> <p>&quot;All over and in over.&quot; And a couple more after that, but I think those are intentional since 027 is kind of losing it.</p> <p>Also, +1</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
