					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Eh&#8230;</p> <p>027 never really blew my skirt up, and while this is well written, the subject matter keeps me from really liking it. The SCiP itself always seemed like a misnomer, like the cloud of beasties was the source of the anomaly rather than the person they infest and devour.</p> <p>It's okay, I suppose.</p> 
				 	]]>
